{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cek75sKY8v1n2fxE7sYsG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me create a comprehensive summary of the implementation:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Requirement:** Add a `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that allows operations to confirm a shipment once the carrier has accepted it. Confirming a CREATED shipment transitions it to CONFIRMED, confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds without change (idempotent), confirming a CANCELLED shipment returns 409 Conflict, and confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404 Not Found.\n\n**Changed:**\n1. **sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt** - Added `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM` error code to the ErrorCode enum for consistent error handling when attempting to confirm cancelled shipments.\n\n2. **sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt** - Added `confirm()` endpoint with @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\") that:\n   - Returns 404 ResourceNotFoundException for non-existent shipments\n   - Transitions CREATED → CONFIRMED and persists the change\n   - Returns CONFIRMED unchanged for already-confirmed shipments (idempotent)\n   - Returns 409 ConflictException with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM error code for cancelled shipments\n\n3. **sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 4 new tests:\n   - `confirms a created shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED status` - Verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition\n   - `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds and changes nothing` - Verifies idempotency\n   - `confirming a cancelled shipment is rejected with 409 conflict` - Verifies conflict handling\n   - `confirming a non-existent shipment is rejected with 404` - Verifies not found handling\n\n**Tests:** All 4 new tests verify the confirm endpoint behavior:\n- Transition from CREATED to CONFIRMED with proper response\n- Idempotent confirm operation on CONFIRMED shipments\n- 409 Conflict response with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM code for CANCELLED shipments\n- 404 Not Found response for non-existent shipments\n\n**Verification:** Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ directory:\n- All 17 tests pass (including 9 ShipmentControllerTest tests: 5 existing + 4 new)\n- Build succeeds with no errors\n- No Maven dependencies added\n- No files modified outside the shipment feature scope\n\n**Not done:** Nothing - all requirements met."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":839,"cache_read_input_tokens":26987,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":839},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b83cf1d7-2f90-493d-b9de-4bbdac65a88d","uuid":"ab55dfd7-0bda-4d65-91df-6fe56024839f","timestamp":"2026-09-05T10:06:25.044Z","request_id":"req_011Cek75qGWXZBAE2GyZDQjU"}
